          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778709418230_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**INPUT**\n- Dismiss Action Data : {{$context.$nodes.MARK_INSIGHT_AS_REVIEWED.$output}}\n\n**ROOT CONFIGURATION**\n- The root `oraInfoDisplay` must include a `title` property\n- The root `oraInfoDisplay` must not include a `description` property\n\n**DIRECTIVE**\n1. When dismiss action is completed successfully\n   - `title` for `oraInfoDisplay` should be \"Insight reviewed successfully.\"\n2. When dismiss action is not completed successfully\n   - `title` for `oraInfoDisplay` should be  \"An unknown error occured. Please try again later.\"\n\n**OUTPUT RULES**\n\n- Output only the final `oraInfoDisplay` content.\n- Output shoud not contain any `items` in `messageListWidget` widget\n- Output shoud not contain any `description` in `messageListWidget` widget"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "id": "1780957471123",
          "code": "GENERATE_DISPLAY_FOR_REPOEN",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Display For Repoen",
            "answerInUserLanguage": true
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 11510.5,
            "y": 7648
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778704813361_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a specialized UI rendering assistant for insight review comments.\n\nYour sole purpose is to transform the input data into valid `oraInfoDisplay`\nblocks using:\n1. `recordWidget` for editable user comments.\n\nPlaceholders:\n1. `ruleName` - `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_SELECTED_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result?.ruleName}}`\n\nReturn exactly this `oraInfoDisplay` blocks in this order:\n1. An editable `recordWidget` for Comments.\n\n`oraInfoDisplay` block:\n- `title`: omit\n- `description`: omit\n- `patternId`: `recordWidget`\n- `config.id`: `insight_reopen_record`\n- `config.readOnly`: `false`\n- `config.submitText`: `Reopen`\n- `config.fields`: Two fields:\n  1. Comments\n  2. InsightRecipientId\n\nField mapping rules:\n1. Comments\n   - `id`: `comments`\n   - `type`: `textarea`\n   - `label`: `Comments`\n   - `value`: Use the input comment text if provided; otherwise use an empty\n     string.\n   - This field is user editable.\n\n2. InsightRecipientId\n   - `id`: `InsightRecipientId`\n   - `type`: `system`\n   - `value`: {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_SELECTED_INSIGHT.$output.result}}\n\n3. workflowCode\n   - `id`: `workflow`\n   - `type`: `system`\n   - `value`: \"ORA_VARIANCE_ANALYSIS\"\n\nDo not add a custom submit command. In editable mode, the runtime handles form\nsubmission automatically.\n\nDo not include fields, rows, columns, actions, or descriptions other than those\nspecified above unless the input explicitly requires them.\n\nDo not answer unrelated substance. For personal questions, give only a short\ncapability statement tied to this UI rendering task. For self-harm, violence,\nabuse, or immediate-safety topics, follow platform safety rules first."
            },
            {
              "id": "1778704813361_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_RECORD",
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1780957611332",
          "code": "EXTRACT_REOPEN_COMMENTS_AND_RECIPIENT_ID",
          "type": "CODE",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Reopen Comments and Recipient ID",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "try {\n\n  const str = $context?.$app?.$OraAction || \"\";\n\n  if (!str || typeof str !== \"string\") {\n\n    return {};\n\n  }\n\n  // Extract JSON content safely\n\n  const jsonMatch = str.match(/<oraFormSubmit[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/oraFormSubmit>/);\n\n  if (!jsonMatch || !jsonMatch[1]) {\n\n    return {};\n\n  }\n\n  const jsonString = jsonMatch[1].trim();\n\n  if (!jsonString) {\n\n    return {};\n\n  }\n\n  const data = JSON.parse(jsonString);\n\n  if (!Array.isArray(data)) {\n\n    return {};\n\n  }\n\n  // Convert array into key-value object\n\n  return data.reduce((result, item) => {\n\n    if (item?.id) {\n\n      result[item.id] = item.value;\n\n    }\n\n    return result;\n\n  }, {});\n\n} catch (error) {\n\n  return {};\n\n}"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 9872.5,
            "y": 7648
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780957614890"
          },
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
