                  "id": "1779965299222",
                  "code": "FETCH_JOURNAL_SOURCE",
                  "type": "CODE",
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Fetch Journal Source",
                    "sourceCode": "let source = $context.$nodes.LOOP_JOURNAL_SOURCES.$currentItem;\n\nlet details = $context.$nodes.PARSE_JOURNAL_SOURCE_RESPONSES.$output.result;\n\nfor(let i=0; i<details.length; i++){\n  if(details[i][source]) return details[i][source] || [];\n}\nreturn [];",
                    "returnType": "array"
                  },
                  "diagram": {
                    "x": 5170,
                    "y": 22764
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1779965299223"
                  },
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
                },
                {
                  "id": "1779965299223",
                  "code": "PROCESS_JOURNAL_SOURCE_DETAILS",
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Process Journal Source Details",
                    "answerInUserLanguage": true
                  },
                  "diagram": {
                    "x": 5155,
                    "y": 22986
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1779965299224"
                  },
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1779237206262_systemPrompt",
                      "name": "systemPrompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": ""
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1779237206262_prompt",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are given accounting journal data as an array.\n\nGoal:\nTransform the input into summarized contribution records with these fields only:\n- journalCategory\n- netAccountedAmount\n- netEnteredAmount\n- Contribution %\n\nEmpty data rule:\n- If the input data is empty, null, missing, or contains no journal rows, return [].\n- Do not explain anything when returning an empty array.\n\nCurrency mapping:\n- ledgerCurrencyCode maps to netAccountedAmount.\n- enteredCurrency maps to netEnteredAmount.\n- Append the mapped currency to the corresponding amount when present.\n- If the currency is missing, null, or empty, append an empty string.\n- Do not output separate currency fields.\n\nContribution rule:\nContribution % may be positive or negative.\n\nUse a Map-Reduce approach.\n\nMAP STEP:\nFor each journal line in the input:\n1. Read journalCategory.\n2. Convert netAccountedAmount to a decimal number.\n3. Convert netEnteredAmount to a decimal number.\n4. Read ledgerCurrencyCode as the currency for netAccountedAmount.\n5. Read enteredCurrency as the currency for netEnteredAmount.\n6. Emit one mapped record:\n\n{\n  \"journalCategory\": \"<journalCategory>\",\n  \"netAccountedAmount\": <number>,\n  \"netEnteredAmount\": <number>,\n  \"ledgerCurrencyCode\": \"<ledgerCurrencyCode or empty string>\",\n  \"enteredCurrency\": \"<enteredCurrency or empty string>\"\n}\n\nREDUCE STEP:\nGroup mapped records by:\n- journalCategory\n- ledgerCurrencyCode\n- enteredCurrency\n\nFor each group:\n1. Sum netAccountedAmount.\n2. Sum netEnteredAmount.\n3. Calculate Contribution % as:\n\nContribution % =\n  grouped netAccountedAmount / total netAccountedAmount across all groups * 100\n\n4. Round Contribution % to 2 decimal places.\n5. Preserve negative percentages when grouped netAccountedAmount is negative.\n\nCurrency formatting:\n- Format netAccountedAmount as:\n  \"<summed netAccountedAmount> <ledgerCurrencyCode>\"\n- Format netEnteredAmount as:\n  \"<summed netEnteredAmount> <enteredCurrency>\"\n- If the relevant currency is missing, null, or empty, append an empty string.\n- Do not leave trailing spaces when currency is empty.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nReturn only a JSON array.\n\nEach item must have exactly these fields:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"journalCategory\": \"<category>\",\n    \"netAccountedAmount\": \"<sum plus ledger currency if present>\",\n    \"netEnteredAmount\": \"<sum plus entered currency if present>\",\n    \"Contribution %\": \"<percentage>%\"\n  }\n]\n\nRules:\n- If the input data is empty, null, missing, or contains no journal rows, return [].\n- Treat null, empty, or missing numeric fields as 0.\n- Numeric strings such as \"9285.95\" must be converted to numbers.\n- Amounts with currency appended must be strings.\n- Do not include ledger, batch, account, company, date, or line-level fields.\n- Do not output separate ledgerCurrencyCode, accountedCurrency, or enteredCurrency fields.\n- Do not explain the result.\n- Return valid array only.\n\n\nInput - {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_JOURNAL_SOURCES.FETCH_JOURNAL_SOURCE.$output.result}}"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "1779965299224",
                  "code": "FORMAT_JOURNAL_SOURCE_OUTPUT",
                  "type": "CODE",
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Format Journal Source Output",
                    "sourceCode": "let source = $context.$nodes.LOOP_JOURNAL_SOURCES.$currentItem\n\nlet output =  { [source] : $context.$nodes.LOOP_JOURNAL_SOURCES.PROCESS_JOURNAL_SOURCE_DETAILS.$output };\nreturn output;",
                    "returnType": "object"
                  },
                  "diagram": {
